  "mission": {
    "heading": "The mission continues",
    "quotes": [
      "If you love the Lord, there is nothing you can't do for Him. We must be losing, suffering, sacrificing and dying for Jesus!",
      "Let us give ourselves wholly, that our profiting may appear to all.",
      "We must go deeper and do more! We must attempt great things for God! We must build a thousand micro churches!",
      "You must catch the anointing, flow in the anointing and amplify your ministry with miracles, signs and wonders.",
      "The church must send or it will end.",
      "Awake, O sleeper! Surely it is worthwhile to push ourselves with all our might in promoting the gospel and the kingdom of our Christ.",
      "Can't you do just a little bit more? Do everything by prayer and nothing without prayer. Let us labour to be blessed!"
    ]
  }
